recorded; sdk_events.json events 0-4."],\n  "methods_actually_executed": ["SDK event 0 Write call-2f193fc147ea481b81576e04d39cefe0 wrote build.py; event 1 Bash call-f896a4105f5b4661b22a93d343b25655 ran Blender, with success log in event 3 and executions/blender_1795841919337226284/stdout.log:1-5.", "executions/blender_1795841919337226284/code/build.py:6-104 constructs flat Principled materials, room and curve wallpaper, window, two rows of desks, eight chairs, two lamps, lights and camera; saves the scene and renders. Original inventory confirms the resulting named objects."],\n  "student_verification": ["The student received the Blender success log, not an image tool result; event 3 reports final.png and scene.blend saved, and event 4 delivers links. No visual comparison or iterative verification appears in sdk_events.json:1-137.", "The delivered final image is available as the candidate input and executions/blender_1795841919337226284/artifacts/final.png; its availability to this annotator is not a student inspection."],\n  "failures_and_recovery": ["input_index.json:8-15 records all three required deliverables and complete_deliverables. evidence_index.json:30-35,43-45,120-149 records one execution, exit 0, no captured Python traceback, and SDK completion; no actual bridge error is established.", "executions/blender_1795841919337226284/stderr.log:1-4 contains Blender deprecation warnings for Material.use_nodes and World.use_nodes, not a recorded execution failure. No recovery is shown."],\n  "side_effects": ["build.py:4 clears the starting Blender objects; build.py:104 saves /app/scene.blend and renders /app/final.png. No other externally facing side effect is shown in sdk_events.json events 0-4."],\n  "spatial_and_orientation_analysis": ["The reference and delivered image both show a central two-pane window above rows of dark desks and white wheeled chairs, with two lamps at the right; visually the candidate is more frontal and distant, has a smaller window and f